**2. Configure Vercel Routing (`vercel.json`)**
If you want Vercel to route requests to your Express app, add a `vercel.json` file in your root directory:

```json
{
  "version": 2,
  "builds": [
    {
      "src": "server.ts",
      "use": "@vercel/node"
    },
    {
      "src": "package.json",
      "use": "@vercel/static-build",
      "config": { "distDir": "dist" }
    }
  ],
  "routes": [
    {
      "src": "/api/(.*)",
      "dest": "server.ts"
    },
    {
      "handle": "filesystem"
    },
    {
      "src": "/(.*)",
      "dest": "/index.html"
    }
  ]
}
